{
  "id": "tidy-for-clippy",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Clippy Gibi Temizle",
    "en": "Tidy Like Clippy"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`list.iter().sum()`",
      "en": "`list.iter().sum()`"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn total(list: &[i32]) -> i32 {\n    list.iter().sum()\n}\n\nfn is_empty_list(list: &[i32]) -> bool {\n    list.is_empty()\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let list = vec![1, 2];\n    println!(\"{} {}\", total(&list), is_empty_list(&list));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn total(list: &[i32]) -> i32 {\n    list.iter().sum()\n}\n\nfn is_empty_list(list: &[i32]) -> bool {\n    list.is_empty()\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let list = vec![1, 2];\n    println!(\"{} {}\", total(&list), is_empty_list(&list));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(total(&[1, 2]), 3);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "toplam",
            "en": "total"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert!(is_empty_list(&[]));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "boş",
            "en": "empty"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert!(!is_empty_list(&[1]));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "dolu",
            "en": "non-empty"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "\\breturn\\b",
      "show": "return"
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "0\\.\\.",
      "show": "0.."
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "&Vec<",
      "show": "&Vec<"
    }
  ]
}
